@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "koroneiki"

Feature: Koroneiki Account API Permission Check
	Testing Koroneiki Account API Permissioning functionality.

Teardown:
	* I tear down the permissions for a koroneiki account with the name "Koroneiki Auto Subsidiary" set for a non permissioned user
	* I tear down the permissions for a koroneiki account with the name "Koroneiki Engr Subsidiary" set for a non permissioned user
	* I tear down the permissions for a koroneiki account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" set for a non permissioned user
	* I tear down the permissions for a koroneiki account with the name "Koroneiki Engineering" set for a non permissioned user
	* I tear down the accounts on koroneiki with the following names
	| Koroneiki Auto Subsidiary |
	| Koroneiki Engr Subsidiary |
	| Koroneiki Automotive      |
	| Koroneiki Engineering     |

Scenario: Create account attempt as non permissioned user
	Koroneiki accounts that are attempted to be created by non permissioned users should not get created.

	Given I attempt to create an account on koroneiki with the following values as a non permissioned user
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                                  | |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Description           | Test automotive account on koroneiki     | |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                             | |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                     | |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                             | |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Region                | United States                            | |
	| Status                | Active                                   | |
	| Tier                  | T4                                       | |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              | |
	Then I should not be able to view a koroneiki account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive"

Scenario: Create child account attempt as non permissioned user
	Koroneiki child accounts that are attempted to be created by non permissioned users should not get created.

	Given I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                                  | |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Description           | Test automotive account on koroneiki     | |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                             | |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                     | |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                             | |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Region                | United States                            | |
	| Status                | Active                                   | |
	| Tier                  | T4                                       | |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              | |
	And I attempt to create a child account for an account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" on koroneiki with the following values as a non permissioned user
	| Code                  | KORAUTOSUB                                 | |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken   | |
	| Description           | Test automotive child account on koroneiki | |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-9012                               | |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Auto Subsidiary                  | |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-3456                               | |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken   | |
	| Region                | United States                              | |
	| Status                | Active                                     | |
	| Tier                  | T4                                         | |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotivesubsidiary.com      | |
	Then I should not be able to view a child koroneiki account with the name "Koroneiki Auto Subsidiary" on the parent account with the name "Koroneiki Engineering"
	And I should not be able to view a koroneiki account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" as a non permissioned user

Scenario: View account attempt as non permissioned user
	Koroneiki accounts created via API should be not viewable via API to non permissioned users.

	Given I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                                  | |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Description           | Test automotive account on koroneiki     | |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                             | |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                     | |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                             | |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Region                | United States                            | |
	| Status                | Active                                   | |
	| Tier                  | T4                                       | |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              | |
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" and the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                                  | |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Description           | Test automotive account on koroneiki     | |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                             | |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                     | |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                             | |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Region                | United States                            | |
	| Status                | Active                                   | |
	| Tier                  | T4                                       | |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              | |
	And I should not be able to view a koroneiki account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" as a non permissioned user

