	And I should not be able to view a child koroneiki account with the name "Koroneiki Auto Subsidiary" on the parent account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" as a non permissioned user

Scenario: Update account attempt as non permissioned user
	Koroneiki accounts that are attempted to be updated by non permissioned users should not get updated.

	Given I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                                  | |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Description           | Test automotive account on koroneiki     | |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                             | |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                     | |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                             | |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Region                | United States                            | |
	| Status                | Active                                   | |
	| Tier                  | T4                                       | |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              | |
	And I attempt to update a koroneiki account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" to have the following values as a non permissioned user
	| Code                  | KORENGR                                  | |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Description           | Test engineering account on koroneiki    | |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-4321                             | |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Engineering                    | |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-8765                             | |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Region                | Japan                                    | |
	| Status                | Active                                   | |
	| Tier                  | T1                                       | |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiengineering.com             | |
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" and the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                                  | |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Description           | Test automotive account on koroneiki     | |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                             | |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                     | |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                             | |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Region                | United States                            | |
	| Status                | Active                                   | |
	| Tier                  | T4                                       | |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              | |
	And I should not be able to view a koroneiki account with the name "Koroneiki Engineering"
	And I should not be able to view a koroneiki account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" as a non permissioned user

