	| Status                | Active                                   | |
	| Tier                  | T4                                       | |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              | |
	And I should not be able to view a koroneiki account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" as a non permissioned user

Scenario: Create account external link attempt as non permissioned user
	Koroneiki account external links should not be able to be created by non permissioned users.

	Given I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                                  | |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Description           | Test automotive account on koroneiki     | |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                             | |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                     | |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                             | |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Region                | United States                            | |
	| Status                | Active                                   | |
	| Tier                  | T4                                       | |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              | |
	And I attempt to create an external link for the account "Koroneiki Automotive" with the following values as a non permissioned user
	| Domain      | koroneikiautomotive |
	| Entity Id   | 1234                |
	| Entity Name | KoroneikiAutomotive |
	Then the external link with the entity id "1234" should not be present on the account "Koroneiki Automotive"

Scenario: View account external link attempt as non permissioned user
	Koroneiki account external links should not be visible by non permissioned users.

	Given I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                                  | |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Description           | Test automotive account on koroneiki     | |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                             | |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                     | |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                             | |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Region                | United States                            | |
	| Status                | Active                                   | |
	| Tier                  | T4                                       | |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              | |
	And I create an external link for the account "Koroneiki Automotive" with the following values
	| Domain      | koroneikiautomotive |
	| Entity Id   | 1234                |
	| Entity Name | KoroneikiAutomotive |
	Then the external link with the entity id "1234" should be present on the account "Koroneiki Automotive" with the following values
	| Domain      | koroneikiautomotive |
	| Entity Id   | 1234                |
	| Entity Name | KoroneikiAutomotive |
	And the external link with the entity id "1234" should not be visible on the account "Koroneiki Automotive" for a non permissioned user
	And I should not be able to view a koroneiki account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" using the external link domain "koroneikiautomotive" and entity name "KoroneikiAutomotive" and entity id "1234" as a non permissioned user

Scenario: Remove account external link attempt as non permissioned user
	Koroneiki account external links should not be removable by non permissioned users.

	Given I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                                  | |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Description           | Test automotive account on koroneiki     | |
	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                             | |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                     | |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                             | |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Region                | United States                            | |
	| Status                | Active                                   | |
	| Tier                  | T4                                       | |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              | |
	And I create an external link for the account "Koroneiki Automotive" with the following values
	| Domain      | koroneikiautomotive |
	| Entity Id   | 1234                |
	| Entity Name | KoroneikiAutomotive |
	And I attempt to delete an external link with the entity id "1234" on the account "Koroneiki Automotive" as a non permissioned user
	Then the external link with the entity id "1234" should be present on the account "Koroneiki Automotive" with the following values
	| Domain      | koroneikiautomotive |
	| Entity Id   | 1234                |
	| Entity Name | KoroneikiAutomotive |
	And the external link with the entity id "1234" should not be visible on the account "Koroneiki Automotive" for a non permissioned user
	And I should not be able to view a koroneiki account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" using the external link domain "koroneikiautomotive" and entity name "KoroneikiAutomotive" and entity id "1234" as a non permissioned user

Scenario: Set account permissions attempt as non permissioned user
	Koroneiki accounts should not be able to have their permissions set by non permissioned users.

	Given I create an account on koroneiki with the following values
	| Code                  | KORAUTO                                  | |
	| Contact Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
