	| Fax Number            | 555-555-1234                             | |
	| Name                  | Koroneiki Automotive                     | |
	| Phone Number          | 555-555-5678                             | |
	| Profile Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken | |
	| Region                | United States                            | |
	| Status                | Active                                   | |
	| Tier                  | T4                                       | |
	| Website               | www.koroneikiautomotive.com              | |
	And I attempt to set the permissions for a koroneiki account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" to have the following values for a non permissioned user as a non permissioned user
	| Update | true |
	| View   | true |
	Then I should not be able to view a koroneiki account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" as a non permissioned user
	When I attempt to update a koroneiki account with the name "Koroneiki Automotive" to have the following values as a non permissioned user
